-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 01: The Museum Heist
-- =======================================================================
(
    1,
    1,
    'Đêm khai mạc (2024-01-15), một bức tranh vô giá biến mất khỏi Gallery A. Báo động kích hoạt lúc 22:05. Kẻ trộm phải là khách VIP đã vào Gallery A VÀ rời bảo tàng trước khi báo động. Tìm người đó. Hiển thị: full_name, entry_at, exit_at.',
    'On the opening night (2024-01-15), a priceless painting disappeared from Gallery A. The security alarm triggered at exactly 22:05. The thief must be a VIP guest who entered Gallery A AND left the museum before the alarm. Find them. Display: full_name, entry_at, exit_at.',
    'You need data from both ''visitors'' and ''security_events'' tables. Use JOIN on visitor_id to connect them.',
    'Filter: badge_zone = ''VIP'', zone = ''GALLERY_A'', event_type = ''ZONE_ENTERED''. These three conditions narrow it down.',
    'Add one more condition to the WHERE clause: v.exit_at < ''2024-01-15 22:00:00''. This is who left before the alarm went off.',
    'JOIN,WHERE,DATETIME_FILTER'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 02: The Social Media Stalker
-- =======================================================================
(
    2,
    1,
    'Một tài khoản ẩn danh đã gửi hàng loạt tin nhắn đe dọa. Để tìm ra người thật đằng sau, bạn cần truy vết các địa chỉ IP đã đăng nhập vào những tài khoản gửi tin nhắn bị gắn cờ — và chỉ giữ lại những IP xuất hiện từ 3 lần trở lên. Hiển thị: ip_address, login_count. Sắp xếp giảm dần.',
    'An anonymous account sent a series of threatening messages online. To find the real person behind it, you need to trace which IP addresses logged into accounts that sent flagged messages — and only keep IPs that appeared 3 or more times. Display: ip_address, login_count. Sort by login_count descending.',
    'You need 3 tables: messages (to find flagged ones), accounts (to link), and login_logs (to find IPs). Start with messages WHERE is_flagged = 1.',
    'JOIN messages → accounts → login_logs. Then GROUP BY ip_address and COUNT the logins.',
    'Use HAVING COUNT(*) >= 3 to filter IPs that logged in 3 or more times. Add ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC.',
    'JOIN,GROUP_BY,HAVING,COUNT,ORDER_BY'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 03: The Neon Club Murder
-- =======================================================================
(
    3,
    1,
    'Vào đêm 2024-03-10, một vụ án mạng xảy ra bên trong VIP Room tại Neon Club. Hãy tìm tất cả hội viên đã vào VIP Room trong khoảng thời gian từ 21:00:00 đến 23:00:00 đêm đó. Hiển thị: full_name, membership_tier, entry_at, exit_at.',
    'On 2024-03-10, a murder occurred inside the VIP Room at Neon Club. Find all members who entered the VIP Room between 21:00:00 and 23:00:00 that night. Display: full_name, membership_tier, entry_at, exit_at.',
    'Join ''members'' with ''entry_logs'' on member_id.',
    'Filter by room = ''VIP_ROOM'' and entry_at between ''2024-03-10 21:00:00'' and ''2024-03-10 23:00:00''.',
    'SELECT m.full_name, m.membership_tier, el.entry_at, el.exit_at FROM members m JOIN entry_logs el ON m.id = el.member_id WHERE el.room = ''VIP_ROOM'' AND el.entry_at >= ''2024-03-10 21:00:00'' AND el.entry_at <= ''2024-03-10 23:00:00'';',
    'JOIN,WHERE,DATETIME_RANGE'
),
(
    3,
    2,
    'Pháp y phát hiện độc chất trong một ly đồ uống pha chế theo yêu cầu đặc biệt. Trong số các hội viên có mặt tại VIP Room trong khung giờ trên, ai là người đã gọi đồ uống đặc biệt (is_special_request = 1) tại quầy bar trước khi bước vào phòng VIP (trước 21:25:00)? Hiển thị: full_name, drink_name, ordered_at.',
    'Forensics found trace poison in a customized drink cocktail. From the members identified in the VIP Room, find who ordered a special request drink (is_special_request = 1) at the bar prior to entering the VIP Room (ordered_at < ''2024-03-10 21:25:00''). Display: full_name, drink_name, ordered_at.',
    'Use a subquery with IN to match members who were in the VIP Room during the crime window.',
    'Join ''members'' with ''drink_orders'' and check is_special_request = 1 and ordered_at < ''2024-03-10 21:25:00''.',
    'SELECT m.full_name, do.drink_name, do.ordered_at FROM members m JOIN drink_orders do ON m.id = do.member_id WHERE m.id IN (SELECT el.member_id FROM entry_logs el WHERE el.room = ''VIP_ROOM'' AND el.entry_at >= ''2024-03-10 21:00:00'' AND el.entry_at <= ''2024-03-10 23:00:00'') AND do.is_special_request = 1 AND do.ordered_at < ''2024-03-10 21:25:00'';',
    'SUBQUERY,JOIN,WHERE,IS_SPECIAL_REQUEST'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 04: The Drug Syndicate
-- =======================================================================
(
    4,
    1,
    'Cục phòng chống ma túy nghi ngờ có hoạt động rửa tiền qua các cửa hàng bán lẻ khai báo doanh thu cao bất thường so với giá trị hàng tồn kho thực tế. Trong khoảng thời gian từ 2024-02-01 đến 2024-03-01, hãy tìm tất cả các cửa hàng có tỷ lệ trung bình giữa declared_revenue và actual_inventory_value lớn hơn 3.0. Hiển thị: store_name, district, avg_ratio (làm tròn 2 chữ số thập phân). Sắp xếp avg_ratio giảm dần.',
    'Narcotics intelligence suspects money laundering through retail stores declaring abnormally high revenues compared to actual inventory. Between 2024-02-01 and 2024-03-01, find all stores whose average ratio of declared_revenue to actual_inventory_value exceeds 3.0. Display: store_name, district, and avg_ratio (round to 2 decimal places). Sort by avg_ratio descending.',
    'Join ''stores'' with ''daily_revenue'' on store_id.',
    'Group by store and calculate AVG(dr.declared_revenue / dr.actual_inventory_value). Filter using HAVING > 3.0.',
    'SELECT s.store_name, s.district, ROUND(AVG(dr.declared_revenue / dr.actual_inventory_value), 2) AS avg_ratio FROM stores s JOIN daily_revenue dr ON s.id = dr.store_id WHERE dr.report_date >= ''2024-02-01'' AND dr.report_date <= ''2024-03-01'' GROUP BY s.id, s.store_name, s.district HAVING AVG(dr.declared_revenue / dr.actual_inventory_value) > 3.0 ORDER BY avg_ratio DESC;',
    'AVG,GROUP_BY,HAVING,JOIN,ROUND'
),
(
    4,
    2,
    'Hãy chỉ đích danh ông trùm đứng sau đường dây: đối chiếu chủ sở hữu của các cửa hàng có tỷ lệ bất thường nói trên với hồ sơ tiền án tiền sự (has_criminal_record = 1). Hiển thị: full_name, phone, store_name.',
    'Now pinpoint the cartel boss behind this network: cross-reference the owners of these high-ratio stores with criminal background records (has_criminal_record = 1). Display: full_name, phone, store_name.',
    'Join ''owners'' and ''stores''. Check has_criminal_record = 1.',
    'Filter stores using a subquery that selects store_id from daily_revenue having AVG ratio > 3.0.',
    'SELECT o.full_name, o.phone, s.store_name FROM owners o JOIN stores s ON o.id = s.owner_id WHERE o.has_criminal_record = 1 AND s.id IN (SELECT dr.store_id FROM daily_revenue dr WHERE dr.report_date >= ''2024-02-01'' AND dr.report_date <= ''2024-03-01'' GROUP BY dr.store_id HAVING AVG(dr.declared_revenue / dr.actual_inventory_value) > 3.0);',
    'SUBQUERY,JOIN,WHERE,HAVING'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 05: The Bank Embezzlement
-- =======================================================================
(
    5,
    1,
    'Kiểm toán nội bộ phát hiện một vụ biển thủ theo phương thức ''lát xúc xích'' (salami slicing) khi nhân viên tự khởi tạo và tự phê duyệt các giao dịch rút tiền. Hãy tìm nhân viên có tổng giá trị giao dịch rút tiền (WITHDRAWAL) tự phê duyệt vượt quá 500,000,000. Hiển thị: full_name, department, total_amount, transaction_count. Sắp xếp total_amount giảm dần.',
    'Internal audit detected a ''salami slicing'' embezzlement scheme where an employee initiates and self-approves unauthorized withdrawals. Find any employee whose self-approved WITHDRAWAL transactions exceed 500,000,000 in total stolen value. Display: full_name, department, total_amount, transaction_count. Sort by total_amount descending.',
    'Join ''employees'' with ''transactions'' on e.id = t.initiated_by.',
    'Self-approval means initiated_by = approved_by. Add t.transaction_type = ''WITHDRAWAL''.',
    'SELECT e.full_name, e.department, SUM(t.amount) AS total_amount, COUNT(*) AS transaction_count FROM employees e JOIN transactions t ON e.id = t.initiated_by WHERE t.transaction_type = ''WITHDRAWAL'' AND t.initiated_by = t.approved_by GROUP BY e.id, e.full_name, e.department HAVING SUM(t.amount) > 500000000 ORDER BY total_amount DESC;',
    'JOIN,GROUP_BY,HAVING,SUM,SELF_CONDITION'
),
(
    5,
    2,
    'Xác định tất cả tài khoản ngân hàng bị Derek Walsh (initiated_by = 1) nhắm tới trong các giao dịch rút tiền tự phê duyệt, và tính tổng số tiền đã bị rút từ mỗi tài khoản. Hiển thị: account_number, owner_name, total_stolen. Sắp xếp total_stolen giảm dần.',
    'Identify all bank accounts targeted by Derek Walsh (initiated_by = 1) in his self-approved withdrawals, and calculate the total amount stolen per account. Display: account_number, owner_name, total_stolen. Sort by total_stolen descending.',
    'Join ''accounts'' with ''transactions'' on account_number.',
    'Filter by t.initiated_by = 1, t.transaction_type = ''WITHDRAWAL'', and t.initiated_by = t.approved_by.',
    'SELECT a.account_number, a.owner_name, SUM(t.amount) AS total_stolen FROM accounts a JOIN transactions t ON a.account_number = t.account_number WHERE t.initiated_by = 1 AND t.transaction_type = ''WITHDRAWAL'' AND t.initiated_by = t.approved_by GROUP BY a.account_number, a.owner_name ORDER BY total_stolen DESC;',
    'JOIN,GROUP_BY,SUM,WHERE'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 06: The Serial Killer
-- =======================================================================
(
    6,
    1,
    'Đội điều tra trọng án đang truy vết một kẻ giết người hàng loạt nhắm vào 7 nạn nhân. Sử dụng CTE để xác định người đã gặp ít nhất 3 nạn nhân khác nhau trong vòng 48 giờ trước khi họ mất tích (TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, meeting_at, disappeared_at) BETWEEN 0 AND 48). Hiển thị: full_name, phone, victim_count.',
    'Homicide investigators are tracking a serial killer who targeted 7 individuals. Write a CTE query to identify any person who met at least 3 different victims within 48 hours prior to their disappearance (TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, meeting_at, disappeared_at) BETWEEN 0 AND 48). Display: full_name, phone, victim_count.',
    'Create a CTE that joins ''meetings'' with ''victims'' on m.person_b_id = v.person_id.',
    'Calculate TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, m.meeting_at, v.disappeared_at) BETWEEN 0 AND 48, then GROUP BY person_a_id HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT v.id) >= 3.',
    'WITH victim_meetings AS (SELECT m.person_a_id AS suspect_id, COUNT(DISTINCT v.id) AS victim_count FROM meetings m JOIN victims v ON m.person_b_id = v.person_id WHERE TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, m.meeting_at, v.disappeared_at) BETWEEN 0 AND 48 GROUP BY m.person_a_id HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT v.id) >= 3) SELECT p.full_name, p.phone, vm.victim_count FROM victim_meetings vm JOIN persons p ON vm.suspect_id = p.id;',
    'CTE,JOIN,TIMESTAMPDIFF,GROUP_BY,HAVING'
),
(
    6,
    2,
    'Đối chiếu dữ liệu trạm phát sóng di động (BTS): tìm nghi phạm từ kết quả phân tích cuộc gặp ở trên mà cũng có cuộc gọi từ trạm phát sóng trùng khớp với địa điểm cuối cùng nạn nhân được nhìn thấy trong vòng 6 giờ trước khi mất tích. Hiển thị: full_name.',
    'Cross-reference cellular records: find which suspect from the previous meeting analysis also made phone calls from a cell tower matching the victim''s last known location within 6 hours before disappearance (TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, pl.call_at, v.disappeared_at) BETWEEN 0 AND 6). Display: full_name.',
    'Join ''persons'', ''phone_logs'', and ''victims'' where pl.tower_location = v.last_known_location.',
    'Filter with a subquery of suspects who met at least 3 victims within 48h.',
    'SELECT DISTINCT p.full_name FROM persons p JOIN phone_logs pl ON p.id = pl.caller_id JOIN victims v ON pl.tower_location = v.last_known_location AND TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, pl.call_at, v.disappeared_at) BETWEEN 0 AND 6 WHERE p.id IN (SELECT m.person_a_id FROM meetings m JOIN victims v2 ON m.person_b_id = v2.person_id WHERE TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, m.meeting_at, v2.disappeared_at) BETWEEN 0 AND 48 GROUP BY m.person_a_id HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT v2.id) >= 3);',
    'SUBQUERY,JOIN,TIMESTAMPDIFF'
),
(
    6,
    3,
    'Xếp hạng tất cả cá nhân dựa trên số lần điện thoại của họ kết nối tới trạm phát sóng tại hiện trường biến mất của nạn nhân trong vòng 6 giờ. Sử dụng Window Function RANK(). Hiển thị: full_name, crime_scene_count, suspect_rank.',
    'Rank all individuals based on how many times their phone connected to cell towers matching victim disappearance locations within 6 hours. Use the RANK() window function. Display: full_name, crime_scene_count, suspect_rank.',
    'Join ''persons'' with ''phone_logs'' and ''victims''. Match tower_location with last_known_location.',
    'Use RANK() OVER (ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC). Group by p.id, p.full_name.',
    'SELECT p.full_name, COUNT(*) AS crime_scene_count, RANK() OVER (ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC) AS suspect_rank FROM persons p JOIN phone_logs pl ON p.id = pl.caller_id JOIN victims v ON pl.tower_location = v.last_known_location AND TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, pl.call_at, v.disappeared_at) BETWEEN 0 AND 6 GROUP BY p.id, p.full_name;',
    'WINDOW_FUNCTION,RANK,GROUP_BY'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 07: The Crypto Mixer
-- =======================================================================
(
    7,
    1,
    'Cảnh sát phòng chống tội phạm mạng đang truy vết dòng tiền chuộc dữ liệu tống tiền (ransomware) được rửa qua chuỗi ví trung gian. Sử dụng RECURSIVE CTE để tìm tất cả các ví có thể tiếp cận trong vòng 3 bước chuyển (hop_count <= 3) bắt đầu từ bất kỳ ví nguồn nào bị gắn cờ (is_flagged = 1). Hiển thị: id, wallet_address, hop_count. Sắp xếp theo hop_count.',
    'Cybercrime investigators are tracing ransomware extortion proceeds laundered through mixer hops. Using RECURSIVE CTE, discover all wallets reachable within 3 transfer hops starting from any flagged source wallet (is_flagged = 1). Display: id, wallet_address, hop_count. Order by hop_count.',
    'Define a RECURSIVE CTE with base query: SELECT id AS wallet_id, 0 AS hop_count FROM wallets WHERE is_flagged = 1.',
    'UNION ALL with recursive query: SELECT ct.to_wallet_id, mt.hop_count + 1 FROM money_trail mt JOIN crypto_transfers ct ON mt.wallet_id = ct.from_wallet_id WHERE mt.hop_count < 3.',
    'WITH RECURSIVE money_trail AS (SELECT id AS wallet_id, 0 AS hop_count FROM wallets WHERE is_flagged = 1 UNION ALL SELECT ct.to_wallet_id, mt.hop_count + 1 FROM money_trail mt JOIN crypto_transfers ct ON mt.wallet_id = ct.from_wallet_id WHERE mt.hop_count < 3) SELECT DISTINCT w.id, w.wallet_address, mt.hop_count FROM money_trail mt JOIN wallets w ON mt.wallet_id = w.id WHERE mt.hop_count > 0 ORDER BY mt.hop_count;',
    'RECURSIVE_CTE,JOIN'
),
(
    7,
    2,
    'Tổng hợp dòng tiền đen: tính tổng số tiền (USD) mà mỗi ví trong chuỗi 3 bước nói trên đã nhận được. Hiển thị: wallet_address, total_received_usd. Sắp xếp total_received_usd giảm dần.',
    'Aggregate the dirty money: calculate the total amount in USD received by each wallet within this 3-hop trail. Display: wallet_address, total_received_usd. Order by total_received_usd descending.',
    'Use the same RECURSIVE CTE from question 1.',
    'Join with ''crypto_transfers'' on ct.to_wallet_id = w.id and compute SUM(ct.amount_usd).',
    'WITH RECURSIVE money_trail AS (SELECT id AS wallet_id, 0 AS hop_count FROM wallets WHERE is_flagged = 1 UNION ALL SELECT ct.to_wallet_id, mt.hop_count + 1 FROM money_trail mt JOIN crypto_transfers ct ON mt.wallet_id = ct.from_wallet_id WHERE mt.hop_count < 3) SELECT w.wallet_address, SUM(ct.amount_usd) AS total_received_usd FROM money_trail mt JOIN wallets w ON mt.wallet_id = w.id JOIN crypto_transfers ct ON ct.to_wallet_id = w.id WHERE mt.hop_count > 0 GROUP BY w.id, w.wallet_address ORDER BY total_received_usd DESC;',
    'RECURSIVE_CTE,JOIN,SUM,GROUP_BY'
),
(
    7,
    3,
    'Xác định kẻ thụ hưởng cuối cùng của đường dây rửa tiền: tìm người thật có đăng ký danh tính sở hữu ví đích (dead-end wallet) trong chuỗi chuyển tiền (ví nhận được tiền trong chuỗi, không bị gắn cờ và chưa bao giờ chuyển tiền ra cho bất kỳ ví nào khác). Hiển thị: wallet_address, full_name, country.',
    'Find the ultimate beneficiary of the money laundering ring: discover the registered real person who owns a dead-end wallet in the trail (a wallet that received funds in the trail, is not flagged, and has never transferred funds out to any other wallet). Display: wallet_address, full_name, country.',
    'Find wallets in the money_trail that have a non-null owner_id and is_flagged = 0.',
    'Use NOT IN (SELECT DISTINCT from_wallet_id FROM crypto_transfers) to ensure it is a dead end.',
    'WITH RECURSIVE money_trail AS (SELECT id AS wallet_id FROM wallets WHERE is_flagged = 1 UNION ALL SELECT ct.to_wallet_id FROM money_trail mt JOIN crypto_transfers ct ON mt.wallet_id = ct.from_wallet_id) SELECT w.wallet_address, rp.full_name, rp.country FROM wallets w JOIN real_persons rp ON w.owner_id = rp.id WHERE w.id IN (SELECT wallet_id FROM money_trail) AND w.id NOT IN (SELECT DISTINCT from_wallet_id FROM crypto_transfers) AND w.is_flagged = 0;',
    'RECURSIVE_CTE,LEFT_JOIN,NULL_PATTERN'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 08: The Rigged Election
-- =======================================================================
(
    8,
    1,
    'Giám sát viên bầu cử nghi ngờ có gian lận nhồi phiếu. Xác định bất kỳ điểm bỏ phiếu nào có tổng số phiếu bầu ghi nhận vượt quá số cử tri thực tế có mặt (COUNT(DISTINCT v.id) > COUNT(DISTINCT va.id)). Hiển thị: station_name, district, total_votes, total_attendance.',
    'Election integrity monitors suspect ballot-box stuffing. Identify any polling station where total votes cast exceed the actual registered voter attendance (COUNT(DISTINCT v.id) > COUNT(DISTINCT va.id)). Display: station_name, district, total_votes, total_attendance.',
    'Join ''polling_stations'' with both ''votes'' and ''voter_attendance'' on station_id.',
    'Group by station and use HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT v.id) > COUNT(DISTINCT va.id).',
    'SELECT ps.station_name, ps.district, COUNT(DISTINCT v.id) AS total_votes, COUNT(DISTINCT va.id) AS total_attendance FROM polling_stations ps JOIN votes v ON ps.id = v.station_id JOIN voter_attendance va ON ps.id = va.station_id GROUP BY ps.id, ps.station_name, ps.district HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT v.id) > COUNT(DISTINCT va.id);',
    'GROUP_BY,HAVING,COUNT,JOIN'
),
(
    8,
    2,
    'Phần mềm gian lận tự động thường nhồi nhiều phiếu cùng một giây chính xác. Sử dụng Window Function COUNT() OVER (PARTITION BY ...), hãy phát hiện các thời điểm mà có hơn 1 phiếu bầu được ghi nhận cùng một giây tại cùng một phòng bỏ phiếu. Hiển thị: station_id, voted_at, votes_same_second.',
    'Automated script injection often casts multiple ballots with exact duplicate timestamps. Using the COUNT() OVER (PARTITION BY ...) window function, detect timestamps where more than 1 vote was recorded at the same station during the same second. Display: station_id, voted_at, votes_same_second.',
    'Select station_id, voted_at, COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY station_id, voted_at) AS votes_same_second FROM votes.',
    'Wrap into a subquery or CTE, or filter using HAVING votes_same_second > 1 (in MySQL).',
    'SELECT DISTINCT station_id, voted_at, COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY station_id, voted_at) AS votes_same_second FROM votes HAVING votes_same_second > 1 ORDER BY station_id, voted_at;',
    'WINDOW_FUNCTION,COUNT_OVER,PARTITION_BY'
),
(
    8,
    3,
    'Lật tẩy kẻ hưởng lợi: sử dụng tập hợp có điều kiện CASE WHEN, tính toán cho mỗi ứng viên: số phiếu tại các phòng gian lận (phòng 3 & 7), số phiếu tại các phòng sạch, và tỷ lệ phần trăm phiếu đến từ phòng gian lận (làm tròn 1 chữ số thập phân). Hiển thị: candidate, votes_in_fraud_stations, votes_in_clean_stations, fraud_pct. Sắp xếp votes_in_fraud_stations giảm dần.',
    'Uncover the beneficiary: using CASE WHEN conditional aggregation, calculate for each candidate: votes won in fraud stations (stations 3 & 7), votes won in clean stations, and the fraud percentage (round to 1 decimal). Display: candidate, votes_in_fraud_stations, votes_in_clean_stations, fraud_pct. Order by votes_in_fraud_stations descending.',
    'Use SUM(CASE WHEN v.station_id IN (3,7) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) for fraud votes.',
    'Calculate fraud_pct as ROUND(100.0 * votes_in_fraud / total_votes, 1).',
    'SELECT c.full_name AS candidate, SUM(CASE WHEN v.station_id IN (3,7) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS votes_in_fraud_stations, SUM(CASE WHEN v.station_id NOT IN (3,7) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS votes_in_clean_stations, ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN v.station_id IN (3,7) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*), 1) AS fraud_pct FROM candidates c JOIN votes v ON c.id = v.candidate_id GROUP BY c.id, c.full_name ORDER BY votes_in_fraud_stations DESC;',
    'CASE_WHEN,CONDITIONAL_AGGREGATION,SUM'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 09: The Corporate Spy
-- =======================================================================
(
    9,
    1,
    'Phát hiện vi phạm nghiêm trọng về cấp độ bảo mật: tìm các nhân viên có clearance_level <= 2 nhưng đã truy cập các tệp tin được phân loại ''TOP_SECRET'' hoặc ''SECRET'', cùng với tên người quản lý trực tiếp của họ. Sử dụng Self-JOIN trên bảng employees. Hiển thị: employee_name, department, manager_name, file_name, classification, accessed_at.',
    'Identify severe security clearance violations: find employees with clearance_level <= 2 who accessed files classified as ''TOP_SECRET'' or ''SECRET'', along with the name of their direct reporting manager. Use a Self-JOIN on employees. Display: employee_name, department, manager_name, file_name, classification, accessed_at.',
    'Join ''file_access_logs'' with ''employees'' (e) and Self-JOIN with ''employees'' (m) on e.manager_id = m.id.',
    'Filter by e.clearance_level <= 2 and fal.classification IN (''SECRET'', ''TOP_SECRET'').',
    'SELECT e.full_name AS employee_name, e.department, m.full_name AS manager_name, fal.file_name, fal.classification, fal.accessed_at FROM employees e JOIN employees m ON e.manager_id = m.id JOIN file_access_logs fal ON e.id = fal.employee_id WHERE e.clearance_level <= 2 AND fal.classification IN (''SECRET'', ''TOP_SECRET'') ORDER BY fal.accessed_at;',
    'SELF_JOIN,JOIN,WHERE,IN'
),
(
    9,
    2,
    'Phát hiện hành vi tải dữ liệu hàng loạt chớp nhoáng: đối với employee_id = 2 (Julian Croft), tìm các sự kiện tải tệp tin diễn ra trong vòng 10 phút kể từ lần tải trước đó bằng hàm Window LAG(). Hiển thị: file_name, accessed_at, prev_accessed_at, minutes_since_prev.',
    'Detect rapid burst exfiltration: for employee_id = 2 (Julian Croft), find consecutive file download events that took place within 10 minutes of the previous download using the LAG() window function. Display: file_name, accessed_at, prev_accessed_at, minutes_since_prev.',
    'Use LAG(accessed_at) OVER (ORDER BY accessed_at) to retrieve the previous download timestamp.',
    'Calculate TIMESTAMPDIFF(MINUTE, prev_accessed_at, accessed_at) <= 10 in an outer query or CTE.',
    'WITH download_timeline AS (SELECT file_name, accessed_at, LAG(accessed_at) OVER (ORDER BY accessed_at) AS prev_accessed_at FROM file_access_logs WHERE employee_id = 2 AND action = ''DOWNLOAD'') SELECT file_name, accessed_at, prev_accessed_at, TIMESTAMPDIFF(MINUTE, prev_accessed_at, accessed_at) AS minutes_since_prev FROM download_timeline WHERE prev_accessed_at IS NOT NULL AND TIMESTAMPDIFF(MINUTE, prev_accessed_at, accessed_at) <= 10;',
    'WINDOW_FUNCTION,LAG,CTE,TIMESTAMPDIFF'
),
(
    9,
    3,
    'Xác thực hành vi gián điệp thương mại: tìm nhân viên vừa kích hoạt các cảnh báo bất thường mức độ HIGH, vừa chuyển hơn 500 MB dữ liệu qua kết nối VPN. Hiển thị: full_name, department, total_exfiltrated_mb, flag_count.',
    'Confirm corporate espionage: find any employee who triggered HIGH severity anomaly flags AND transferred more than 500 MB of data over VPN. Display: full_name, department, total_exfiltrated_mb, flag_count.',
    'Join ''employees'' with ''network_logs'' (is_vpn = 1) and ''anomaly_flags'' (severity = ''HIGH'').',
    'Calculate SUM(nl.data_transferred_mb) and COUNT(DISTINCT af.id). Use HAVING SUM > 500.',
    'SELECT e.full_name, e.department, SUM(nl.data_transferred_mb) AS total_exfiltrated_mb, COUNT(DISTINCT af.id) AS flag_count FROM employees e JOIN network_logs nl ON e.id = nl.employee_id JOIN anomaly_flags af ON e.id = af.employee_id WHERE nl.is_vpn = 1 AND af.severity = ''HIGH'' GROUP BY e.id, e.full_name, e.department HAVING SUM(nl.data_transferred_mb) > 500;',
    'JOIN,GROUP_BY,HAVING,SUM,COUNT_DISTINCT'
),

-- =======================================================================
-- CASE 10: The Supply Chain Sabotage
-- =======================================================================
(
    10,
    1,
    'Tập đoàn MegaLogistics đang đứng trước nguy cơ đứt gãy chuỗi cung ứng do các đơn hàng liên tục bị trì hoãn ác ý. Hãy xếp hạng nhân viên dựa trên số lượng đơn hàng mà họ đã dời ngày giao dự kiến quá 30 ngày (DATEDIFF(new_expected_date, old_expected_date) > 30). Hiển thị: full_name, delayed_orders, avg_days_delayed, sabotage_rank.',
    'MegaLogistics is facing supply chain breakdown caused by severe order delay sabotage. Rank employees based on the number of delivery orders they postponed by more than 30 days (DATEDIFF(new_expected_date, old_expected_date) > 30). Display: full_name, delayed_orders, avg_days_delayed, sabotage_rank.',
    'Join ''delivery_history'' with ''employees'' on dh.changed_by = e.id.',
    'Filter DATEDIFF(dh.new_expected_date, dh.old_expected_date) > 30. Group by employee and apply RANK() OVER (ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC).',
    'SELECT e.full_name, COUNT(*) AS delayed_orders, AVG(DATEDIFF(dh.new_expected_date, dh.old_expected_date)) AS avg_days_delayed, RANK() OVER (ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC) AS sabotage_rank FROM delivery_history dh JOIN employees e ON dh.changed_by = e.id WHERE DATEDIFF(dh.new_expected_date, dh.old_expected_date) > 30 GROUP BY e.id, e.full_name;',
    'RANK,WINDOW_FUNCTION,GROUP_BY,DATEDIFF'
),
(
    10,
    2,
    'Nhiều nhà cung cấp trọng yếu đã bị xóa khỏi hệ thống quản lý trong khi các đơn hàng giá trị cao vẫn đang trong quá trình vận chuyển. Tìm tất cả các nhà cung cấp bị xóa (is_deleted = 1) nhưng vẫn còn đơn hàng dở dang (status IN (''PENDING'', ''SHIPPED'')) và tính tổng thiệt hại tài chính. Hiển thị: company_name, country, deleted_at, stranded_orders, total_loss. Sắp xếp total_loss giảm dần.',
    'Critical vendors were deleted from the supplier master list while high-value purchase orders were still in transit. Find all deleted suppliers (is_deleted = 1) with active unfulfilled orders (status IN (''PENDING'', ''SHIPPED'')) and calculate the total financial exposure. Display: company_name, country, deleted_at, stranded_orders, total_loss. Order by total_loss descending.',
    'Join ''suppliers'' with ''orders'' on s.id = o.supplier_id.',
    'Filter by s.is_deleted = 1 and o.status IN (''PENDING'', ''SHIPPED''). Compute SUM(o.quantity * o.unit_price).',
    'SELECT s.company_name, s.country, s.deleted_at, COUNT(o.id) AS stranded_orders, SUM(o.quantity * o.unit_price) AS total_loss FROM suppliers s JOIN orders o ON s.id = o.supplier_id WHERE s.is_deleted = 1 AND o.status IN (''PENDING'', ''SHIPPED'') GROUP BY s.id, s.company_name, s.country, s.deleted_at ORDER BY total_loss DESC;',
    'JOIN,WHERE,GROUP_BY,SUM,DECIMAL_CALC'
),
(
    10,
    3,
    'Kiểm tra nhật ký kiểm toán (audit trail) để phát hiện các hành vi phá hoại lén lút ngoài giờ làm việc (trước 07:00 hoặc từ 20:00 trở đi). Sử dụng CASE WHEN, tìm nhân viên có hơn 5 lần chỉnh sửa hệ thống ngoài giờ. Hiển thị: full_name, total_actions, after_hours_actions, deletions. Sắp xếp after_hours_actions giảm dần.',
    'Examine the audit trail for covert sabotage outside authorized business hours (defined as before 07:00 or at/after 20:00). Using CASE WHEN conditional aggregation, find any employee with more than 5 after-hours system modifications. Display: full_name, total_actions, after_hours_actions, deletions. Order by after_hours_actions descending.',
    'Join ''audit_trail'' with ''employees'' on performed_by = e.id.',
    'Use SUM(CASE WHEN HOUR(performed_at) < 7 OR HOUR(performed_at) >= 20 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) for after_hours_actions.',
    'SELECT e.full_name, COUNT(*) AS total_actions, SUM(CASE WHEN HOUR(at.performed_at) < 7 OR HOUR(at.performed_at) >= 20 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS after_hours_actions, SUM(CASE WHEN at.action = ''DELETE'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS deletions FROM audit_trail at JOIN employees e ON at.performed_by = e.id GROUP BY e.id, e.full_name HAVING SUM(CASE WHEN HOUR(at.performed_at) < 7 OR HOUR(at.performed_at) >= 20 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) > 5 ORDER BY after_hours_actions DESC;',
    'CASE_WHEN,CONDITIONAL_AGGREGATION,HAVING'
),
(
    10,
    4,
    'Dựng lại dòng thời gian phá hoại của Ryan Cooper: sử dụng CTE và hàm LAG(), lập trình tự thời gian các hành động của Ryan (performed_by = 1) từ ngày ''2024-02-20'' trở đi, tính toán số phút trôi qua giữa các thao tác liên tiếp. Hiển thị: event_type, detail, event_time, prev_event_time, minutes_since_prev.',
    'Reconstruct Ryan Cooper''s malicious timeline: using CTE and the LAG() window function, assemble a chronological timeline of Ryan''s actions (performed_by = 1) from ''2024-02-20'' onwards, calculating the elapsed minutes between consecutive operations. Display: event_type, detail, event_time, prev_event_time, minutes_since_prev.',
    'Create a CTE selecting action, formatted detail string, and performed_at as event_time for performed_by = 1.',
    'Apply LAG(event_time) OVER (ORDER BY event_time) and TIMESTAMPDIFF(MINUTE, LAG(event_time) OVER (ORDER BY event_time), event_time).',
    'WITH ryan_timeline AS (SELECT action AS event_type, CONCAT(table_name, ''.'', COALESCE(changed_field,''N/A''), '': '', COALESCE(old_value,''''), '' -> '', COALESCE(new_value,'''')) AS detail, performed_at AS event_time FROM audit_trail WHERE performed_by = 1 AND performed_at >= ''2024-02-20 00:00:00'') SELECT event_type, detail, event_time, LAG(event_time) OVER (ORDER BY event_time) AS prev_event_time, TIMESTAMPDIFF(MINUTE, LAG(event_time) OVER (ORDER BY event_time), event_time) AS minutes_since_prev FROM ryan_timeline ORDER BY event_time;',
    'CTE,LAG,WINDOW_FUNCTION,TIMESTAMPDIFF'
);

